<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O Morning Star! Ascend before the dawning,</l><l>In twilight radiate—how clear and bright!</l><l>While here we love and wait for Thy dear coming,</l><l>Silently, Thou illuminate our night.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O Morning Star! Spring forth from my heart’s fountain,</l><l>As we attend to Thy prophetic word;</l><l>Glow as a lamp amidst apostate darkness,</l><l>Until the morn arrives in all the earth.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>O Morning Star! Appear to us Thy seekers!</l><l>Midst this black hour, we wait for Thy return.</l><l>Earnestly longing for Thy hidden presence;</l><l>Our fond Reward, for Thee we dearly yearn!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
